  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Par 203.04 Notice of Hearings. Notice of any scheduled parole shall be issued by the executive assistant according to the provisions of RSA 651-A:11. The executive assistant shall also provide written notice to each inmate scheduled for a hearing.\n\nSource. #7149, eff 12-7-99, EXPIRED: 12-7-07\n\nNew. #9070, INTERIM, eff 1-11-08, EXPIRED: 7-9-08\n\nNew. #9254, eff 9-6-08; ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17 (from Par 203.05)",
